{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar 2026-09-22 (SEO: product-faq-missing-on-product-template)
  "Veelgestelde vragen" panel for the product-page accordion. Every answer is
  derived from product data (spray modes, filter / hose state via the shower-*
  snippets) and theme settings (return window, warranty, free-shipping
  threshold); nothing is hard-coded per product handle. Shower family only.
  No FAQPage JSON-LD on purpose: Google shows no FAQ rich results for shops.
  Usage: {% render 'besjaar-product-faq', product: product %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bpf_product = product
  capture bpf_capture
    render 'product-family', product: bpf_product
  endcapture
  assign bpf_family = bpf_capture | strip
-%}
